","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Summon a Minotaur for %d turns to attack your foes. Minotaurs cannot stay summoned for long, but they deal high damage.\n\t\tIt will get %d Strength, %d Constitution and %d Dexterity.\n\t\tYour summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%%, resistance penetration %%, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.\n\t\tThe minotaur's Strength and Dexterity will increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤一只米诺陶来攻击敌人，持续 %d 回合。米诺陶不会呆很长时间，但是它们会造成极大伤害。\n\t\t它拥有 %d 点力量，%d 点体质和 %d 点敏捷。\n\t\t你的召唤物继承你部分属性：增加百分比伤害、抗性穿透、震慑/定身/混乱/致盲抵抗和护甲穿透。\n\t\t米诺陶的力量和敏捷受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a5c2ecb711536c1ca8548d3daffe3b2ac44670a8428bc6d6702668a6a4da722e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcb0d325daacfbf106ec57005e6954ea3efef8c12f37a010a571dbc28bd4d13e","logical_entry_identity":"72e82bc7755b52bf19c402e7060a46acb5b9cda982804ad7dd3d6d6da97a9dd9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# has finished recovering.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#停止了复原。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"84bde9a1a2d9b2fe4229f6875d69b1977d4f4ff6a2a0f7de8f90b9586305348e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcbcf95da63a0e9d9bcd1736cc453fb6f2a34c8312706cdcdae02e765951edaa","logical_entry_identity":"078253bb82fa652cdd04646dd539257fa2db0e7ec2d6fb157f57d300e4ba95e3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"archer","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"弓箭手"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e4d1926fef8e39f94432b8f4733771114d3120041ecf88f6be322df4d9d4336","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcc0a8a5ef9b9f961ce3dcac5ea41665bf0d08de631f7b6bb0551366f71b0750","logical_entry_identity":"3123aa0161e87a6f6cd17a13b620f716ae26e1d43d6b963ae4ad9b7e32bd5716","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"...We are lost. The orcish forces are too great. No matter how many our squad slays, yet more surge from the depths. Where are the cursed creatures coming from?! We have spied their leader, but have had no hope in killing him; he is a beast, a destroyer, burning with fire infernal and ice cruel and chilling. The power these orcs wield now fills me with dread... perhaps they have found new, mighty allies? This news must reach our ruler. My comrades... I am sorry. I will flee once the opportunity arises, but know that your sacrifices will not be in vain. Long may our empire endure.","source_tag":"_t","target":"……我们完了。兽人大军势不可当。无论我们小队杀死多少，都会有更多兽人从深处涌来。这些该死的生物究竟从哪里来的？！\n我们已经窥见他们的首领，却根本没有希望杀死他；他是一头野兽，一个毁灭者，身燃炼狱烈火与残酷刺骨的寒冰。这些兽人如今掌握的力量令我恐惧……或许他们找到了新的强大盟友？这消息必须送到统治者手中。战友们……对不起。我会在机会出现时逃走，但要知道，你们的牺牲绝不会白费。愿帝国长存。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ff302adab8794fefd1e46197e1119d43615fb6ed4da67ae3a5484a71ed7eaf32","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcc1c02597cf5a8f2e0f9a18c21053631bfd0d190c7e7d32afa781b9e1fac08e","logical_entry_identity":"902a929364ec7cf0f2dd2e2293239a888472513ba33e23b361fa411b77d5c5e0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Temporal","source_tag":"_t","target":"时空"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6639d4d39c6fe9291be35fb4239b3246ab9c70115a5e0da1a99f4dd385688bd9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bcc4d0bd11ae323e2936e940091ce2e966133eef77290b0799d84d27ea9c8ce9","logical_entry_identity":"94ffa74ba82547e83638c6431e66736dbbd84aea9f2653c053d7aef5df7fd9e8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This crimson shape drips ceaselessly, spattering the nearby ground. The droplets seem to continue moving of their own volition.","source_tag":"_t","target":"血红色的物体不断滴落液体，散落在地面上。滴落下来的血液似乎有着自己的意志。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a54c5d48b0fe45c95886efe8ca64be088c7a3f608f7ce1fede026aad17d688b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bccd05abf267248cc73174de331a84f6c502ce06cc3f4d8ecc41d69ea367dea0","logical_entry_identity":"776eabbdbb1f9df03c1c154dbbb309362321b87bd37fedc8fdaf91c80ef356b8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Demonic Invasion","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"恶魔入侵"},{"args_o